            "notes": "If you're REALLY confident about hitting your Whips, take  [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) .  However, I would recommend waiting until next round when we have  [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) .  Ability Power will give you good cash generation, but you could also take Survivability items depending on how you're feeling.\n\nIf you have a ton of cash, [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) is better than  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) .",
