            "notes": "Now that we have our Whip Shot online, the build will start to pivot towards helping the team.   [Mitzi's Medicine](item_382d3dbd-63b8-453f-9be3-fefc3600dd24) has excellent stats and gives good value to Repair Packs.\n\nIf you don't have the cash for  [Mitzi's Medicine](item_382d3dbd-63b8-453f-9be3-fefc3600dd24) yet or if you want to play it safe, then you can also run Survivability items or anything from the previous round.  Only buy the Purple if you have plenty of money.",
