            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-29T19:34:33.314813+00:00",
            "notes": "As a backline build, it's time to start juicing up our repair packs with  [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) .  This goes great with  [Mitzi's Medicine](item_382d3dbd-63b8-453f-9be3-fefc3600dd24) to get the full value of the healing.\n\nFor the rest of your cash, it's whatever you think will give you the best mix of survivability, ability power, and cooldowns.  If you're mega-rich then buy Cybervenom.  Those 200+ damage Whipshots?  Now they're applying anti-heal, making the damage even more urgent and taking people out of the fight for even longer.   [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) is a similar idea, making our whipshot nukes even more of a problem.\n\nOne small tip:  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) costs about the same as two  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) 's.  So if you have enough cash for another Blue but are low on inventory space, you could sell the one for the other.",
